Dear &nbsp;Jacky Goddard&nbsp;<br>
<br>
Thank you, I’m really pleased to confirm your deposit has been received for your stay at Bonté arriving on&nbsp;Sunday the&nbsp;25th July 2027 for&nbsp;7 nights.&nbsp;<br>
<br>
You have a wonderful holiday to look forward to!&nbsp; Bonté is located in a&nbsp;very special part of the world, and I want your time there to feel effortless, relaxed and genuinely memorable.<br>
<br>
Most guests arrive with plans but quickly settle into a relaxed rhythm; slow mornings with coffee on the terrace, time by the pool, exploring local markets and vineyards.&nbsp; Evenings tend to end the same way, outside with a drink watching the sun set over the vineyards.<br>
<br>
